{"id": "DfaAgX7xXXQ", "title": "Video by vedic_twist", "description": "Aaj jo sona ghar aayega, uske peeche ek dulhan ki kahani hai, jisne Yamraj ko bina kisi hathiyar ke rok diya.\n\nLok-katha: Raja Hima ke bete ki kundli mein likha tha ki shaadi ki chauthi raat saanp ke kaatne se uski maut hogi. Dulhan ne darwaze pe gehne aur sikke rakhe, poore kamre mein diye jalaye, aur saari raat kahaniyan sunayi. Saanp bankar aaye Yamraj chamak se andar nahi ja paaye aur subah laut gaye.\n\nParampara: Kartik trayodashi ki shaam Yamraj ke naam ek diya, ghar ke bahar, dakshin ki taraf. Skanda aur Padma Puran mein bhi is din Yama ke liye deep ka zikr milta hai.\n\nAaj miss ho gaya? Kai gharon mein Choti Diwali ki shaam bhi Yamraj ke naam ka diya jalta hai.\n\nSave karo taaki kal shaam yaad rahe, aur us couple ko bhejo jinki ye pehli Diwali hai.\n\nAnkahi Kahaniyan, Ep 09. Kal Choti Diwali: Narakasur.\n\nDhanteras ki kahani | Yam deepdaan | Yamraj ki kahani\n\n#dhanteras #yamraj #ankahikahaniyan", "channel": "vedic_twist", "uploader_id": "30248523911", "uploader": "Vedic twist | Mahabharata facts", "timestamp": 1793981659, "like_count": 1006, "comment_count": 0, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/145.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1160391049755730a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 63.168, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQM8PNrdYoIOYJCMIWrE5YP05Ql7GOEWPx92F5JyHSogF7midxKWijub0vnSkUUCCW0ZDLqS9aL75LpsDe6UnFWOhcB83GAeOMFJSDA.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=Adp8po3E98K_DMB5WsH8cfRnXocg1fqAodp4B5EcBO9yHYdbX9k6xqoQ4R7jlFvSEUTTBeKf9rrXVIp5qJseKDvE&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.f